{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000<strong>INTRODUCTION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This work is a\u00a0Adventure told from a first-person perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The theme of this title is &quot;lie and unnecessary.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3000STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character is a boy who overslept while riding the water monorail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He is woken up in an unknown location by an announcement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When he heads to the entrance, there's only one humanoid conductor there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >According to her, this is an unmanned observation deck on the water, and it is impossible to go out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She also informs him that the next monorail train is 45 hours away, leaving him at a loss as to what to do...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000<strong>POINT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This work is divided into two parts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the story part, the scenario progresses through conversations with characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the commentary part, you can read about the history surrounding the art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>*Please read the guidelines on the official website regarding streaming the play video of this work.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3285320?t=1752522248","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285320/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752522248","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285320/90ea761b071ed9229fa689e1dc2aae4f974cd7c6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752522248","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285320/90ea761b071ed9229fa689e1dc2aae4f974cd7c6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752522248","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000<strong>INTRODUCTION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This work is a\u00a0Adventure told from a first-person perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The theme of this title is &quot;lie and unnecessary.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3000STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character is a boy who overslept while riding the water monorail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He is woken up in an unknown location by an announcement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When he heads to the entrance, there's only one humanoid conductor there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >According to her, this is an unmanned observation deck on the water, and it is impossible to go out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She also informs him that the next monorail train is 45 hours away, leaving him at a loss as to what to do...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000<strong>POINT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This work is divided into two parts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the story part, the scenario progresses through conversations with characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the commentary part, you can read about the history surrounding the art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>*Please read the guidelines on the official website regarding streaming the play video of this work.</p>","developers":["Akechine"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285320/header.jpg?t=1752522248","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended"